@startuml
[*] --> TaskInput

TaskInput --> EvaluateAvailabilityAndWorkload : Input Task Description

EvaluateAvailabilityAndWorkload --> GenerateSuggestedAssignments : Evaluate Availability and Workload

GenerateSuggestedAssignments --> TaskAssignment : Assign Task
GenerateSuggestedAssignments --> ModifyTask : Modify Task
GenerateSuggestedAssignments --> CancelTask : Cancel Task

TaskAssignment --> TaskAssigned : Task Assigned
